                &lt;div&gt;
                    
                        &lt;article&gt;
                            &lt;h2&gt;&lt;a href="https://github.com/StackExchange/StackExchange.Redis/releases/tag/3.4.20"&gt;3.4.20&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/h2&gt;
                            &lt;div&gt;
                                &lt;h2&gt;Stability improvements&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Do not abandon a connection attempt before ConnectTimeout has elapsed by &lt;a class="user-mention notranslate" data-hovercard-type="user" data-hovercard-url="/users/mgravell/hovercard" data-octo-click="hovercard-link-click" data-octo-dimensions="link_type:self" href="https://github.com/mgravell"&gt;@mgravell&lt;/a&gt; in &lt;a class="issue-link js-issue-link" data-error-text="Failed to load title" data-id="5864341719" data-permission-text="Title is private" data-url="https://github.com/StackExchange/StackExchange.Redis/issues/3277" data-hovercard-type="pull_request" data-hovercard-url="/StackExchange/StackExchange.Redis/pull/3277/hovercard" href="https://github.com/StackExchange/StackExchange.Redis/pull/3277"&gt;#3277&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Read HELLO "server" before trusting "version" as the Redis API version by &lt;a class="user-mention notranslate" data-hovercard-type="user" data-hovercard-url="/users/mgravell/hovercard" data-octo-click="hovercard-link-click" data-octo-dimensions="link_type:self" href="https://github.com/mgravell"&gt;@mgravell&lt;/a&gt; in &lt;a class="issue-link js-issue-link" data-error-text="Failed to load title" data-id="5880920046" data-permission-text="Title is private" data-url="https://github.com/StackExchange/StackExchange.Redis/issues/3279" data-hovercard-type="pull_request" data-hovercard-url="/StackExchange/StackExchange.Redis/pull/3279/hovercard" href="https://github.com/StackExchange/StackExchange.Redis/pull/3279"&gt;#3279&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Sentinel soft-fail follow-ups: discovery failure as RedisConnectionException, late sentinel init, clear LastException by &lt;a class="user-mention notranslate" data-hovercard-type="user" data-hovercard-url="/users/mgravell/hovercard" data-octo-click="hovercard-link-click" data-octo-dimensions="link_type:self" href="https://github.com/mgravell"&gt;@mgravell&lt;/a&gt; in &lt;a class="issue-link js-issue-link" data-error-text="Failed to load title" data-id="5881722074" data-permission-text="Title is private" data-url="https://github.com/StackExchange/StackExchange.Redis/issues/3280" data-hovercard-type="pull_request" data-hovercard-url="/StackExchange/StackExchange.Redis/pull/3280/hovercard" href="https://github.com/StackExchange/StackExchange.Redis/pull/3280"&gt;#3280&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Sentinel: re-resolve the primary when it is demoted on a healthy connection by &lt;a class="user-mention notranslate" data-hovercard-type="user" data-hovercard-url="/users/rebaseandpanic/hovercard" data-octo-click="hovercard-link-click" data-octo-dimensions="link_type:self" href="https://github.com/rebaseandpanic"&gt;@rebaseandpanic&lt;/a&gt; in &lt;a class="issue-link js-issue-link" data-error-text="Failed to load title" data-id="5898360980" data-permission-text="Title is private" data-url="https://github.com/StackExchange/StackExchange.Redis/issues/3281" data-hovercard-type="pull_request" data-hovercard-url="/StackExchange/StackExchange.Redis/pull/3281/hovercard" href="https://github.com/StackExchange/StackExchange.Redis/pull/3281"&gt;#3281&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Route as a cluster only with a slot map; take HELLO mode/role from the interactive connection only by &lt;a class="user-mention notranslate" data-hovercard-type="user" data-hovercard-url="/users/mgravell/hovercard" data-octo-click="hovercard-link-click" data-octo-dimensions="link_type:self" href="https://github.com/mgravell"&gt;@mgravell&lt;/a&gt; in &lt;a class="issue-link js-issue-link" data-error-text="Failed to load title" data-id="5976532849" data-permission-text="Title is private" data-url="https://github.com/StackExchange/StackExchange.Redis/issues/3285" data-hovercard-type="pull_request" data-hovercard-url="/StackExchange/StackExchange.Redis/pull/3285/hovercard" href="https://github.com/StackExchange/StackExchange.Redis/pull/3285"&gt;#3285&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Fail connection-dropped commands with RedisConnectionException, never a raw transport exception or a cancellation by &lt;a class="user-mention notranslate" data-hovercard-type="user" data-hovercard-url="/users/mgravell/hovercard" data-octo-click="hovercard-link-click" data-octo-dimensions="link_type:self" href="https://github.com/mgravell"&gt;@mgravell&lt;/a&gt; in &lt;a class="issue-link js-issue-link" data-error-text="Failed to load title" data-id="5977684587" data-permission-text="Title is private" data-url="https://github.com/StackExchange/StackExchange.Redis/issues/3287" data-hovercard-type="pull_request" data-hovercard-url="/StackExchange/StackExchange.Redis/pull/3287/hovercard" href="https://github.com/StackExchange/StackExchange.Redis/pull/3287"&gt;#3287&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Connection groups: a member answering LOADING triggers an immediate re-probe and re-select by &lt;a class="user-mention notranslate" data-hovercard-type="user" data-hovercard-url="/users/mgravell/hovercard" data-octo-click="hovercard-link-click" data-octo-dimensions="link_type:self" href="https://github.com/mgravell"&gt;@mgravell&lt;/a&gt; in &lt;a class="issue-link js-issue-link" data-error-text="Failed to load title" data-id="5980369278" data-permission-text="Title is private" data-url="https://github.com/StackExchange/StackExchange.Redis/issues/3289" data-hovercard-type="pull_request" data-hovercard-url="/StackExchange/StackExchange.Redis/pull/3289/hovercard" href="https://github.com/StackExchange/StackExchange.Redis/pull/3289"&gt;#3289&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;IBatch: complete commands refused by a poisoned connection; divert a batch's tail on reconnect by &lt;a class="user-mention notranslate" data-hovercard-type="user" data-hovercard-url="/users/mgravell/hovercard" data-octo-click="hovercard-link-click" data-octo-dimensions="link_type:self" href="https://github.com/mgravell"&gt;@mgravell&lt;/a&gt; in &lt;a class="issue-link js-issue-link" data-error-text="Failed to load title" data-id="5977430244" data-permission-text="Title is private" data-url="https://github.com/StackExchange/StackExchange.Redis/issues/3286" data-hovercard-type="pull_request" data-hovercard-url="/StackExchange/StackExchange.Redis/pull/3286/hovercard" href="https://github.com/StackExchange/StackExchange.Redis/pull/3286"&gt;#3286&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Give multi-message sub-commands and injected prefix commands a write time by &lt;a class="user-mention notranslate" data-hovercard-type="user" data-hovercard-url="/users/mgravell/hovercard" data-octo-click="hovercard-link-click" data-octo-dimensions="link_type:self" href="https://github.com/mgravell"&gt;@mgravell&lt;/a&gt; in &lt;a class="issue-link js-issue-link" data-error-text="Failed to load title" data-id="5994794450" data-permission-text="Title is private" data-url="https://github.com/StackExchange/StackExchange.Redis/issues/3293" data-hovercard-type="pull_request" data-hovercard-url="/StackExchange/StackExchange.Redis/pull/3293/hovercard" href="https://github.com/StackExchange/StackExchange.Redis/pull/3293"&gt;#3293&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Send primary-only commands to the primary when the caller prefers a replica by &lt;a class="user-mention notranslate" data-hovercard-type="user" data-hovercard-url="/users/AsadIqbal-Dev/hovercard" data-octo-click="hovercard-link-click" data-octo-dimensions="link_type:self" href="https://github.com/AsadIqbal-Dev"&gt;@AsadIqbal-Dev&lt;/a&gt; in &lt;a class="issue-link js-issue-link" data-error-text="Failed to load title" data-id="5987575961" data-permission-text="Title is private" data-url="https://github.com/StackExchange/StackExchange.Redis/issues/3291" data-hovercard-type="pull_request" data-hovercard-url="/StackExchange/StackExchange.Redis/pull/3291/hovercard" href="https://github.com/StackExchange/StackExchange.Redis/pull/3291"&gt;#3291&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h2&gt;Maintenance&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Tests: stabilise two recurring Windows CI flakes (hash-field expiry clock skew, backlog counter quiescence) by &lt;a class="user-mention notranslate" data-hovercard-type="user" data-hovercard-url="/users/mgravell/hovercard" data-octo-click="hovercard-link-click" data-octo-dimensions="link_type:self" href="https://github.com/mgravell"&gt;@mgravell&lt;/a&gt; in &lt;a class="issue-link js-issue-link" data-error-text="Failed to load title" data-id="5980368439" data-permission-text="Title is private" data-url="https://github.com/StackExchange/StackExchange.Redis/issues/3288" data-hovercard-type="pull_request" data-hovercard-url="/StackExchange/StackExchange.Redis/pull/3288/hovercard" href="https://github.com/StackExchange/StackExchange.Redis/pull/3288"&gt;#3288&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Tests: don't race the connect's own reconfigures in AllClusterCommandsRefusedIsQuiet by &lt;a class="user-mention notranslate" data-hovercard-type="user" data-hovercard-url="/users/mgravell/hovercard" data-octo-click="hovercard-link-click" data-octo-dimensions="link_type:self" href="https://github.com/mgravell"&gt;@mgravell&lt;/a&gt; in &lt;a class="issue-link js-issue-link" data-error-text="Failed to load title" data-id="5981576663" data-permission-text="Title is private" data-url="https://github.com/StackExchange/StackExchange.Redis/issues/3290" data-hovercard-type="pull_request" data-hovercard-url="/StackExchange/StackExchange.Redis/pull/3290/hovercard" href="https://github.com/StackExchange/StackExchange.Redis/pull/3290"&gt;#3290&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Refresh package pins: 10.0.13 servicing family and tooling by &lt;a class="user-mention notranslate" data-hovercard-type="user" data-hovercard-url="/users/mgravell/hovercard" data-octo-click="hovercard-link-click" data-octo-dimensions="link_type:self" href="https://github.com/mgravell"&gt;@mgravell&lt;/a&gt; in &lt;a class="issue-link js-issue-link" data-error-text="Failed to load title" data-id="5995516668" data-permission-text="Title is private" data-url="https://github.com/StackExchange/StackExchange.Redis/issues/3294" data-hovercard-type="pull_request" data-hovercard-url="/StackExchange/StackExchange.Redis/pull/3294/hovercard" href="https://github.com/StackExchange/StackExchange.Redis/pull/3294"&gt;#3294&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;xunit.v3 4.0 on Microsoft.Testing.Platform by &lt;a class="user-mention notranslate" data-hovercard-type="user" data-hovercard-url="/users/mgravell/hovercard" data-octo-click="hovercard-link-click" data-octo-dimensions="link_type:self" href="https://github.com/mgravell"&gt;@mgravell&lt;/a&gt; in &lt;a class="issue-link js-issue-link" data-error-text="Failed to load title" data-id="5995669997" data-permission-text="Title is private" data-url="https://github.com/StackExchange/StackExchange.Redis/issues/3295" data-hovercard-type="pull_request" data-hovercard-url="/StackExchange/StackExchange.Redis/pull/3295/hovercard" href="https://github.com/StackExchange/StackExchange.Redis/pull/3295"&gt;#3295&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;StyleCop.Analyzers 1.3.151-beta, and the tidy-up it asks for by &lt;a class="user-mention notranslate" data-hovercard-type="user" data-hovercard-url="/users/mgravell/hovercard" data-octo-click="hovercard-link-click" data-octo-dimensions="link_type:self" href="https://github.com/mgravell"&gt;@mgravell&lt;/a&gt; in &lt;a class="issue-link js-issue-link" data-error-text="Failed to load title" data-id="5996643806" data-permission-text="Title is private" data-url="https://github.com/StackExchange/StackExchange.Redis/issues/3296" data-hovercard-type="pull_request" data-hovercard-url="/StackExchange/StackExchange.Redis/pull/3296/hovercard" href="https://github.com/StackExchange/StackExchange.Redis/pull/3296"&gt;#3296&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h2&gt;New Contributors&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;a class="user-mention notranslate" data-hovercard-type="user" data-hovercard-url="/users/AsadIqbal-Dev/hovercard" data-octo-click="hovercard-link-click" data-octo-dimensions="link_type:self" href="https://github.com/AsadIqbal-Dev"&gt;@AsadIqbal-Dev&lt;/a&gt; made their first contribution in &lt;a class="issue-link js-issue-link" data-error-text="Failed to load title" data-id="5987575961" data-permission-text="Title is private" data-url="https://github.com/StackExchange/StackExchange.Redis/issues/3291" data-hovercard-type="pull_request" data-hovercard-url="/StackExchange/StackExchange.Redis/pull/3291/hovercard" href="https://github.com/StackExchange/StackExchange.Redis/pull/3291"&gt;#3291&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Full Changelog&lt;/strong&gt;: &lt;a class="commit-link" href="https://github.com/StackExchange/StackExchange.Redis/compare/3.4.5...3.4.20"&gt;&lt;tt&gt;3.4.5...3.4.20&lt;/tt&gt;&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
